{"title": "Legendary Action: Grasping Appendage", "pageid": 45220, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Grasping_Appendage", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Utility.webp, /w/images/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Grasping Appendage</b> is a legendary action <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a>, that lets him pull an enemy towards him.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, Malus Thorm can use his Legendary Action to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Appendage\" title=\"Grasping Appendage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/25px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/38px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/50px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/25px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Appendage\" title=\"Grasping Appendage\">Grasp</a> a creature and pull it closer. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Grasping_Appendage\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Grasping Appendage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Grasping_Appendage_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Grasping Appendage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Grasping Appendage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Grasping_Appendage_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Grasping Appendage (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Grasping Appendage</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Once per round, Malus Thorm can spend a Legendary Action to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Appendage\" title=\"Grasping Appendage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/25px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/38px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/50px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grasping Appendage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp/25px-Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Grasping_Appendage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Appendage\" title=\"Grasping Appendage\">Grasping Appendage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201326\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1046/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10014/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3439/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 136/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643744/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.638      1 -total\n 98.94%   35.259      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 29.68%   10.576      2 Template:Icon_link\n 28.60%   10.193      2 Template:Icon_text\n 27.03%    9.633      1 Template:SAI\n 25.06%    8.932      6 Template:Trim\n 22.08%    7.870      1 Template:Condition\n 19.94%    7.106      2 Template:Ifempty\n 13.10%    4.669      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.24%    4.361      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:45220-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201326 and revision id 272551. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}